flowchart TD
    A([LoRaTask Start])

    A --> B{{while true}}
    B --> C[Wait for Task Notification]
    C --> D[Read LoRa Packet]

    D --> E{Read Successful?}

    E -- No --> Z[Restart LoRa Receive]
    Z --> B

    E -- Yes --> F[Null Terminate Packet]

    F --> G{Packet == 'C'?}

    G -- No --> T[Queue Packet]
    G -- Yes --> H[Print Complete Packet]

    H --> I[Copy temperatureDetected to History]
    I --> J[Reset temperatureDetected]

    J --> K[Read Receiver CPU Temperature]
    K --> L[Convert °C to °F]

    L --> M[Build Variable Packet<br/>V,sleep,OLED,debug]
    M --> N[Convert Packet to Uppercase]
    N --> O[Delay Before TX]

    O --> P[Transmit Variable Packet]

    P --> Q{TX Successful?}

    Q -- Yes --> R[Print Sent Packet]
    Q -- No --> S[Print TX Error]

    R --> U
    S --> U

    U[Save Current Variables<br/>as Previous Values]
      --> V[resetVariablesFlag = false]

    V --> W[Reset runningTimer]
    W --> X[lastSenderState = Awake]
    X --> Y[newPacketReceived = true]

    Y --> T

    T[Send Packet to Queue]
      --> Z

    Z --> B
